WEBVTT

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:05.960
Is that really...

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:08.940
Don't worry!

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.360
Noel will make Nonoka's wish come true for sure!

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:21.720
Nonoka?

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:26.880
We... were all together then.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.200
Yuzuki, Koharu, even Mizusaka-kun.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.210
Togawa-san too...

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.360
Nonoka?

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:36.720
Guys!

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:42.870
Nonoka!

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.600
Look, we're all together now!

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.900
Now, we can...

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.310
Together, together...

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.930
All together!

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:54.910
I need to tell you guys something.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.120
We should head back before it gets any darker.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.580
I agree.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.900
Let's rejoin the rest of our class first.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:02.920
Let's go, Nonoka.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:03.990
Wait!

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:06.500
I'd completely forgotten...

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.500
all about the observatory...

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.020
and when we played together...

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.760
how I didn't get to say goodbye...

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:17.640
and how I called the Disc.

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:27.730
Yuzuki!

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:28.890
Wait!

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.030
Hey, Koharu!

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.290
Man...

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:41.820
I'm sorry. I...

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.500
So what if you had forgotten?

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.000
Do you think that makes what you did okay?

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.480
Eh?

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.130
Ta-da!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.640
Alrighty!

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.510
Noel?

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.460
Nonoka!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.520
I'm sorry!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.150
What are you doing here?

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:58.990
Noel thought that Nonoka's wish
would come true if everyone got together,

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.650
but that wasn't it.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:02.030
Huh?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.660
Noel had it wrong!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.360
So she's apologizing!

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:10.860
Wait, what do you mean, "wish?"

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:13.380
Noel will do her best!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.410
Um...

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.330
That's why you should cheer up, Nonoka!

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:19.840
Nonoka?

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:23.050
Do we have a guest?

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.550
Dad, don't come out wearing that!

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:29.900
Huh?

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.560
I managed to crack the eggs properly today.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.560
"Noel will do her best...", huh?

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:41.260
Now, we don't want the lovely breakfast
your daddy cooked to get co—

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:43.400
Sorry! I have to leave now!

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:45.170
W-Wait!

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.180
"Noel," wasn't it?

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:19.500
What's up? Couldn't it wait till later?

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.200
I wanted to talk to you.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.530
Um...

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:28.940
I—

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:30.310
Hang on!

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.440
Is this about Nonoka?

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:36.160
I'm not going to forgive her or apologize to her!

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:37.950
Why should I?!

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:39.100
No, it's not that.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.420
Well, I do want to talk about Nonoka too, but—

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:42.970
Then—

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:46.220
Did you set this up?

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.560
I'm going home.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:50.600
Wait!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.950
What the hell do you want?!

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.180
You betrayed us! You disappeared for so long!

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.770
You don't have any idea
what that did to us, do you?!

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.360
I'm sorry.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:09.520
But that's why I want to know.

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.950
What happened to this town?

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.450
Please, Yuzuki! Tell me!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.530
That's...

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:26.710
I don't want to talk about it.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.720
I have some things that I have to do.

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.500
Are you just going to keep campaigning?

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:36.220
Of course I am!

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:39.110
I'm going to chase away the Disc!

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:40.230
Alone!

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.230
Yuzuki, listen to me—

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.110
Leave me alone!

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.220
The Disc, Nonoka, Koharu, Souta...

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.560
I hate all of you!

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.340
Yuzuki!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:02.550
I really... can't do anything.

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:10.420
Hello, Koharu?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.440
What is it?

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:12.550
Souta?

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:14.260
Where are you right now?

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:17.010
I'm on the way back from school.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.240
Oh, I see...

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:23.020
If you'd been in the area, I would
have liked to talk to you about Yuzuki...

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.300
Did something happen?

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:27.440
No, nothing really.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:31.170
I just wasn't able to get through to her again.

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:34.270
Don't wear yourself out on Yuzuki.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.450
My bus is here now,
so I'll have to catch you later.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.710
Hey, wait—

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.270
Man, he couldn't wait another second?

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:54.670
It's all the Disc's fault.

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:10.980
Mizusaka-kun!

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:15.630
Please help!

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.700
We need your support!

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:23.700
Please help us to remove the Disc from our town!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:26.090
Please do your part!

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:28.210
Excuse me!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.950
Please read this.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.090
Thank you!

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.850
If you'd like to know more—

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.430
Please help us!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.810
Could I have just a moment of your time?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:55.560
Please help!

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:57.330
Say no to the Disc!

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:00.570
Please help us!

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:04.200
We need everyone's help to drive away the Disc!

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:06.690
Let's chase away the Disc from our—

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:12.830
Thank you very much!

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:20.250
Why?

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.460
Please help!

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.880
Noel?

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:27.460
I promised.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.860
Thanks.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.940
Let's do this!

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:36.780
Please help!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.360
Please help!
Please help!

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:40.830
We need your help!

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:43.070
Say no to the Disc!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:53.500
Here.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.850
You sure?

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:57.960
Sorry my sister's being so troublesome.

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:00.810
That's because I...

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.970
Thanks, Mizusaka-kun.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.810
You went to school today?

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:17.230
I needed advice about my future education.

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.320
No one else is going to be studying abroad, so...

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:20.290
Eh?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.320
I had no choice but to talk to the teacher.

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:23.800
Abroad?

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:29.500
Just so you know, it's got nothing to do
with my crappy relationship with Yuzuki.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.330
I-I didn't mean...

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:35.830
I made up my mind a while back that I'd go
overseas once I was done with middle school.

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:39.840
What?

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:43.180
You used to fight a lot over those buns.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.840
Come on, that was ages ago.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:53.000
Still, she's doing all of this
because she wants to spite me,

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:55.850
so it might be better for us if
she and I were separated for a bit.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:00.110
Spite you?

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:04.960
She hates me, so she's trying to make my life difficult.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:08.740
I... don't think that's the case.

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:16.580
<i>Some of those things never changed back.</i>

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:21.630
<i>During the summer festival,
fireworks were lit above the lake.</i>

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:23.950
Fireworks.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:24.610
Huh?

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:29.220
Maybe Yuzuki just wants to see the fireworks again.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.260
Fireworks?

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.730
Like we can have those anymore.

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:37.480
Why not?

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:41.110
You promised me we'd go to see them together!

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.930
It's not my fault. They've been canceled because of the Disc.

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.320
I hate you, Onii-chan!

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:55.960
That stupid girl...

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.560
Please!

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:03.380
We need your... your help.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.010
Don't look at the Disc!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:07.740
Please!

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:10.030
Please don't look at the Disc!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:10.970
Why not?

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.400
It's embarrassing.

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:15.140
What?

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.040
No, that's not why!

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:21.150
There's nothing but trouble
for all of us while the Disc is here.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:24.080
Come on Noel, stop saying silly things.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.220
But...!

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.180
Thank you very much.

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:50.890
Excuse me!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:52.680
Sorry!

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:53.230
Hokkaido
Hokkaido

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:54.930
Thank you very much.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.930
Hey, what's going on out there?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.690
I'm extremely sorry.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.460
Please!

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.190
We need your support!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.190
Please help us!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:07.190
Yuzuki.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.070
What?

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:11.840
Would you please stop this?

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:15.190
I'm afraid it's bothering my customers.

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:17.830
I'm not bothering anyone!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.330
I received a complaint from a customer.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:24.230
You're just saying that to try and get rid of me!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:25.340
It's the same wherever I go!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:26.940
Yuzuki, please.

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:28.980
Don't make me do anything else.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.570
What's wrong?

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.350
My deepest apologies, everyone.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:42.010
Wait!

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.720
Please help!

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.310
Um, this is...

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:53.240
I'll help you.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.690
Are you sure?

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:58.600
Of course!

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.410
I'm always on your side, Yuzuki.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.170
<i>Liar.</i>

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:19.130
Yuzuki, where are we going next?

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.410
There's nowhere left to go.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:27.860
Don't worry, Noel will try even harder!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.180
It's fine.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.400
There's no more point to any of this.

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:34.770
Thanks for helping me.

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:35.650
But...!

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:38.700
Thank you.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:42.630
'Kay.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.070
What was with that girl earlier?

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:06.150
What's that Mizusaka girl doing?

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.440
Huh?

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.440
We may come from different towns,

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.690
but if everyone in the class helps,

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:15.780
I'm sure we'll be able to chase away the Disc!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:16.970
What's with her?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:19.280
Man, she hasn't changed since grade school.

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:20.790
I wish she'd just stop.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.790
C'mon guys, listen to me!

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:26.340
I bet you think the same as her, Shiihara-san.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:32.420
I'm not going to make fun of Yuzuki. She's my friend.

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.300
How can you be so mean when
you don't know anything about her?

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.300
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:53.600
Can you stop helping Yuzuki
with the things she's been doing?

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:55.110
Why?

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:59.650
I don't want you to get involved in her nonsense.

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:01.870
I'll be okay.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.960
I'm glad we got to talk.

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:11.880
I didn't really do anything.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:17.080
You should probably be asking Koharu about Yuzuki, not me.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:19.290
Thanks for the drink.

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.970
Have you thought about
making up with Yuzuki?

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:30.480
I doubt that'll happen.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:33.290
I used to have an answer
for everything in the past,

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:37.490
but now, I have no idea how to help her.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.370
You should try talking to Yuzuki.

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:46.750
I will too.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.750
Why doesn't anyone understand?

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:58.490
If no one's going to help, then you can all get lost!

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:07.590
Yuzuki!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:09.390
Yuzuki!

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:12.040
What are you doing, Yuzuki?!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:14.730
Let go!

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:15.650
Don't try to stop me!

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.930
Stop all of this!

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.980
You're causing trouble for everyone!

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:22.240
Nothing will come of this anyway!

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:25.660
You just care more about
your store than me, don't you?

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.750
How could you say something like that?

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:35.430
You're the same as Souta!

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:40.260
You just make fun of what I'm doing!

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:46.350
But you know that what she's doing is a waste of time, don't you?

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:48.180
Well...

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:53.440
You think this is pointless, don't you?

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:58.570
Well?

00:18:58.570 --> 00:18:59.870
You do, don't you?

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.450
I...

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.280
Do you, or don't you?!

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.960
I do.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.000
I hate you.

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:25.070
I guess all I can do is...

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:28.120
Koharu!

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:30.910
Nonoka...

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:32.500
Are you all right?

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:37.310
What's the matter?

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:48.860
I need your help, Koharu.

00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:34.100
Next time, on Sora no Method:

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:35.300
"Flowers of Light."

00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:36.970
Look forward to it!
